[{"client_msg_id":"375b4f70-0b6c-44c6-9842-2c68aea64798","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"メッセージが分割されてるかどうか受け側で分かるようになるとよいのですが。","ts":"1629525405.044200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h1Umj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"673e8e8f-8b79-447f-9329-3ea9cfdfeade","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"Vimがchannelに書き込むデータはfd_writeによりバッファリングされて書き込まれるのでメッセージが分割される可能性があるのですが、RPCの受け側でデータが来たらすぐにメッセージの解釈をしてしまうので壊れたJSONデータをパースしてRPCが壊れます","ts":"1629525073.043400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]},{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U81LLJ340"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k7tP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f2aa3dd5-7aa6-443f-8be5-ec66570a09bc","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"特にWindowsだとバッファーサイズが小さいので簡単に問題が発覚するのですが、他の環境ではバッファーが大きくて発覚しなかったようです","ts":"1629524954.040700","thread_ts":"1629524954.040700","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OSPN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c64a506d-5fa0-4962-81ff-2d8d31845d8a","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"\u003c@U776661HA\u003eさんも調べてくれていますが、現在のVim8 JSON RPCの挙動に問題があります","ts":"1629524879.039500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sfAL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a6a182e4-5b53-42d4-b0a0-ba69b7c5741f","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"Named pipeのバッファサイズが65535しかないらしく、少し大きなVimのバッファの内容を転送するだけでエラーになります","ts":"1629538079.044500","thread_ts":"1629524954.040700","parent_user_id":"U7JL1UKKL","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lh9"}]}]
